# Duskwood and Redridge, second half (about 25 to 26.5).
#
# Since 2026-11-07 Duskwood and Redridge are played together, so Redridge
# comes at 23+ where its quests fit (Ashenvale and Stonetalon first): Duskwood's first
# loop and Redridge (04-redridge-mountains, with Redridge's elites and Fangore
# at about 25 on the same loop through the Blackrock camps and Galardell
# Valley), then Duskwood's second loop here. The first loop's Darkshire
# visit and its quests are in 04-redridge-mountains.
#
# Flow: fly from Lakeshire to Darkshire -> Blind Mary, the Tranquil Gardens
# Cemetery, Madame Eva -> west: Abercrombie, Sven -> Darkshire -> the
# Skeletal Horrors south-east of town (Rot Blossoms, The Night Watch's
# Horrors) -> Darkshire -> west: Abercrombie, the ghouls, the cemetery's
# Skeletal Fiends, Jitters, Sven -> north through Elwynn for training (Shamans in
# Ironforge by the Deeprun Tram, Rogues in Stormwind) -> the Stormwind
# gryphon to Menethil Harbor, where the next guide (06-wetlands) starts. The
# Night Watch's second part is handed in on the Duskwood return
# (07-thousand-needles), where its third part starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Look To The Stars (174): the export finds the Bronze Tube on Venture Co.
#   machines in Stonetalon (a 1-2% drop). The tube comes from the Stormwind
#   Auction House on 04-redridge-mountains' Stormwind stop (Herble Baubbletump,
#   next to Viktori, keeps one and is nearly always sold out, #1348): handed in
#   on the first Darkshire visit, and its second part (175) handed to Blind
#   Mary on her visit; the Insane Ghoul (177, level 26) waits for the Duskwood
#   return (07-thousand-needles).
# - Wolves at Our Heels (226) is turned in on the second visit to Sven's camp
#   (Lars stands beside Sven) instead of walking back west for it.
# - Hearthstone: none here. The second loop ends at Sven's camp in the west,
#   and the walk north through Goldshire (training) to Stormwind's gryphon is
#   on the way to Menethil; the Darkshire flight path and hearth are taken on
#   the first loop's visit (04-redridge-mountains).
# - Dropped Awaiting Word (236): a no-XP breadcrumb to Watcher Callahan at
#   Manor Mistmantle, a detour north the route never passes otherwise.
# - Redridge's elites (Tharil'zun 19, Gath'Ilzogg 169, Incinerator Gar'im
#   95999, Shadow Magic's Blackrock Shadowcasters 115) and Lieutenant Fangore
#   (180, 26) are on 04-redridge-mountains' loop at about 25, where those
#   quests fit: players finished them solo at 21-23 in the recordings, so they
#   are in the route's steps with a tip to group up if you can; the elite
#   Wanted posters' work (169, 95999) is on steps the player opts into
#   (`when group`, #1415: an all-optional step was passed at once, so nobody
#   was led there), Fangore's (not elite) is a plain goal.
# - Worgen in the Woods (173) needs level 23: the step before it says so.
#
# Class quests: Rogues finish Mathias and the Defias with Klaven's Tower
# (2360, 2359, Poisons) at the end: Agent Kearnen and the tower stand just
# over the Westfall border from Raven Hill, and Mathias Shaw is in Stormwind
# on the way to the boat. Optional for Rogues there: The Touch of Zanzil
# (2607-2609, Doc Mixilpixil in the Barracks cellar; Wildflowers and a Leaded
# Vial from Stormwind vendors, a Bronze Tube from the Auction House, the thread
# in the city), 1,305 XP without leaving Stormwind.
# Human Paladins hand the Defias Script (1787, from Henze Faulk in
# 04-redridge-mountains) to Gazin Tenorm at the Stormwind stop and learn
# Redemption from Duthorian Rall (1788).
#
# Left out (not in the export): Jitters' Growling Gut and Dusky Crab Cakes
# (163, 5, 93), Seasoned Wolf Kabobs (90: Cooking), The Weathered Grave chain
# (225: ends at the elite Mor'Ladim), Ira's Dagger (96137: it starts from a
# drop of the Lost Stalkers, Forever's new Duskwood mobs, at an unknown rate,
# and is not in the new consensus either).
# Refresh (2026): Merrick's Bow (96138) now has a known start, a drop of the
# Lost Watchers; the new consensus does it at 28 with the ogres of Vul'Gol,
# so it is an optional extra in 07-thousand-needles' Duskwood return. The
# Valor Family (98447, a Forever quest listed for Duskwood, level 27)
# is not in our data: no giver, objective or ender we can place, so it is
# not added. The Valor Family 96139 (Sirra Von'Indi) stays as it is.
# Checked and skipped: The Legend of Stalvan (98) needs 97 (the Stalvan
# chain through Westfall and Elwynn, not on this route) and ends at Stalvan
# Mistmantle, an elite.

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Back to the Lakeshire gryphon master: fly to Darkshire for Duskwood's second loop.
  goto 25.5,59.4 "Lakeshire flight master"
  fly "Darkshire"

step Blind Mary
  zone Duskwood
  tip Her house stands on the hill south-east of Darkshire, above the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery.
  turnin 149                          -- Inside
  accept 154
  turnin 175
  accept 177                              -- Mary's Looking Glass: the Insane Ghoul in the cemetery's crypt is level 26; it waits for the Duskwood return

step Tranquil Gardens Cemetery
  collect 2794 optional                   -- An Old History Book: a rare drop from Duskwood's mobs
  accept 337 optional

step Madame Eva
  turnin 154                          -- Inside
  accept 157

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West again

step Abercrombie
  tip Head west along the road once more.
  turnin 157
  accept 158

step Sven's Camp
  turnin 226                              -- Lars
  turnin 230                              -- Sven Yorgen
  accept 262

step Back to Darkshire
  tip Head back east to Darkshire.
  turnin 262                              -- Madame Eva, inside
  accept 265
  turnin 265                              -- Clerk Daltry, in the town hall
  accept 266
  turnin 266                              -- Tavernkeep Smitts, in the tavern
  accept 453
  turnin 158                              -- Tavernkeep Smitts
  accept 156

step Rot Blossoms
  tip Skeletal Horrors walk the hillside between Darkshire and the Tranquil Gardens Cemetery, south-east of town; they drop the Rot Blossoms.
  collect 1598 quest 156
  kill 202 quest 57                       -- Skeletal Horror

step Tavernkeep Smitts
  turnin 156                          -- Inside
  accept 159
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Raven Hill

step Abercrombie
  tip Head west to the hermit once more.
  turnin 159
  accept 133

step Ghoul Ribs
  tip Every ghoul of the Raven Hill Cemetery's northern half can drop a rib: Flesh Eaters, Bone Chewers, Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters.
  tip Careful: A Rotted One casts Summon Flesh Eating Worms as it dies, which brings extra adds.
  collect 884 quest 133

step Abercrombie
  turnin 133
  accept 134

step Raven Hill Cemetery: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip Head south through the cemetery towards Raven Hill. Skeletal Fiends and Skeletal Horrors walk its southern half. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.
  kill 531 quest 57                       -- Skeletal Fiend
  kill 202 quest 57                       -- Skeletal Horror

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West

step Jitters
  tip Jitters hides in the house at the west end of Raven Hill.
  turnin 453
  accept 268

step Sven's Camp
  turnin 268                              -- Sven Yorgen
  note Next: training, then the flight from Stormwind to Menethil Harbor for the Wetlands.
  accept 323                              -- Sven Yorgen

step Westfall
  only Rogue
  zone Westfall
  goto 68.5,70.1 "Agent Kearnen"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Rogues: Klaven's Tower

step Agent Kearnen
  only Rogue
  zone Westfall
  tip Head west along the road out of Raven Hill into Westfall. Agent Kearnen watches Klaven Mortwake's tower from the hills just inside the border. The Malformed Defias Drone (level 23) guarding the tower carries its key; Klaven's journal is in the chest at the top.
  turnin 2360                                 -- Agent Kearnen
  accept 2359
  collect 7923 quest 2359.2                   -- Defias Tower Key: Malformed Defias Drone
  collect 7908 quest 2359.1                   -- Klaven Mortwake's Journal, in the chest

step Master Mathias Shaw
  only Rogue
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Head north through Elwynn to Stormwind; Mathias Shaw is at SI:7 in Old Town.
  turnin 2359 reward 18160                    -- Master Mathias Shaw: Poisons, and Recipe: Thistle Tea
  accept 2607 optional                        -- The Touch of Zanzil: Doc Mixilpixil, in the cellar of the Barracks
  turnin 2607 optional
  accept 2608 optional
  complete 2608 optional                      -- /lay down beside Doc Mixilpixil
  turnin 2608 optional
  accept 2609 optional
  buy 3421 x1 npc 1302 optional               -- Simple Wildflowers: Bernard Gump
  buy 3372 x1 npc 1313 optional               -- Leaded Vial: Maria Lumere, Alchemy Supplies
  collect 4371 x1 @61.2,71.3 map 1453 live optional -- Bronze Tube: the Auction House, Trade District; Billibub Cogspinner keeps one and is nearly always sold out
  collect 8431 quest 2609.4 optional @50.6,60.1 live -- Spool of Light Chartreuse Silk Thread
  turnin 2609 optional                        -- Doc Mixilpixil: Eau de Mixilpixil

step Elwynn Forest
  only !Rogue
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip North from Raven Hill through Elwynn: Goldshire is on the road to Stormwind.
  goto 43.5,65.3 "Goldshire"

step Class trainer
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid -- Level 22 and 24 spells

step Gazin Tenorm
  only Human,Paladin
  zone Stormwind City
  tip On into Stormwind: Gazin Tenorm and Duthorian Rall are in the Cathedral of Light, on the way to the gryphon master.
  goto 50.5,47.5 "Cathedral of Light"
  turnin 1787 only Human -- Gazin Tenorm
  accept 1788 only Human
  turnin 1788 only Human -- Duthorian Rall: Redemption

step Stormwind City
  only Shaman
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 64.5,7.5 "Stormwind's Dwarven District"

step Tram to Ironforge
  only Shaman
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 64.5,7.5 "Tram to Ironforge"

step Shaman training
  only Shaman
  zone Ironforge
  tip Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge, train with Eldrun Stormbreaker, then ride the tram back.
  train class

step Rogue training
  only Rogue
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Train here, in Stormwind City, before you go on.
  train class
